id: SHELL24-2
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: fast_forward_host
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:             active: self.fast_forward && live && self.is_busy(),
replace:             active: self.fast_forward && live,
expect-fail: 早送り中は入かつ処理中だけ出る
note: 「早送り中」を処理中でなくても出す（入かつ処理中の条件を外す。SHELL-24）
